@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiểm tra máy chủ → 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập → 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tạo lượt nộp → 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 4. Đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo → 200 (bấm nhiều lần: received → processing → graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu studentCode, repositoryUrl → 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### 6. POST vào bài tập 99 không tồn tại → 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 7. GET lượt nộp với id rỗng → 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR → 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub → 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. (Thêm) POST vào bài tập đã đóng → 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }
